{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_228_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_228","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_228_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_228","textTraditional":"十有五年春王正月，邾子來朝。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_228_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_228","textTraditional":"鼷鼠食郊牛，牛死，改卜牛。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_228_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_228","textTraditional":"二月辛丑，楚子滅胡，以胡子豹歸。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_228_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_228","textTraditional":"夏五月辛亥，郊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_228_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_228","textTraditional":"壬申，公薨于高寢。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_228_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_228","textTraditional":"鄭罕達帥師伐宋。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_228_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_228","textTraditional":"齊侯、衛侯次于渠蒢。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_228_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_228","textTraditional":"邾子來奔喪。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_228_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_228","textTraditional":"秋七月壬申，姒氏卒。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_228_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_228","textTraditional":"八月庚辰朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_228_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_228","textTraditional":"九月，滕子來會葬。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_228_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_228","textTraditional":"丁巳，葬我君定公，雨，不克葬。戊午，日下昃，乃克葬。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_228_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_228","textTraditional":"辛巳，葬定姒。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_ttr_228_15","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_228","textTraditional":"冬，城漆。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_ttr_228_16","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_228","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_ttr_228_17","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_228","textTraditional":"十五年春，邾隱公來朝。子貢觀焉。邾子執玉高，其容仰；公受玉卑，其容俯。子貢曰：「以禮觀之，二君者，皆有死亡焉。夫禮，死生存亡之體也。將左右周旋、進退俯仰，於是乎取之；朝祀喪戎，於是乎觀之。今正月相朝，而皆不度，心已亡矣。嘉事不體，何以能久？高仰，驕也；卑俯，替也。驕近亂，替近疾。君為主，其先亡乎！」","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_ttr_228_18","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_228","textTraditional":"吳之入楚也，胡子盡俘楚邑之近胡者。楚既定，胡子豹又不事楚，曰：「存亡有命，事楚何為？多取費焉。」二月，楚滅胡。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_ttr_228_19","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_228","textTraditional":"夏五月壬申，公薨。仲尼曰：「賜不幸言而中，是使賜多言者也。」","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_ttr_228_20","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_228","textTraditional":"鄭罕達敗宋師于老丘。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_ttr_228_21","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_228","textTraditional":"齊侯、衛侯次于蘧挐，謀救宋也。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_ttr_228_22","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_228","textTraditional":"秋七月壬申，姒氏卒。不稱夫人，不赴，且不祔也。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_ttr_228_23","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_228","textTraditional":"葬定公，雨，不克襄事，禮也。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_ttr_228_24","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_228","textTraditional":"葬定姒，不稱小君，不成喪也。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_ttr_228_25","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_228","textTraditional":"冬，城漆。書，不時告也。","sentenceOrder":25}],"overrides":{}}